# Email Service Configuration

# Resend API Key (RECOMMENDED - https://resend.com)
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com (free tier: 100 emails/day, 3,000/month)
# 2. Get your API key from https://resend.com/api-keys
# 3. Add it below and restart your dev server
# 4. For production, verify your domain in Resend dashboard

RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local (git will ignore it)
# 2. Replace 'your_resend_api_key_here' with your actual API key
# 3. Restart your development server (npm run dev)
# 
# For development without API key:
# - Leave RESEND_API_KEY empty
# - Form will work but emails will be logged to console only
# - Perfect for testing the UI/UX
